stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Opening: Open draft link
  Opening --> Ready: Receive valid schedule or no schedule
  Opening --> Unavailable: Receive malformed schedule
  Unavailable --> Opening: Tap Reload draft
  Ready --> Saving: Tap Approve draft
  Saving --> Unknown: Receipt cannot confirm approval
  Unknown --> Saving: Tap Retry approval with same key
  Saving --> Approved: Receive exact unsent approval receipt
  Opening --> SignedOut: Authorization refused
  Saving --> SignedOut: Authorization refused
  Opening --> Disposed: Leave while opening
  Ready --> Disposed: Leave draft
  Disposed --> Disposed: Late read settles
  %% never Offer approval for an invalid schedule
  %% never Approve automatically
  %% never Render a late read after disposal
